# Files bundled with the desktop app are staged here at build time: now only
# the network database snapshot, i2pd-netdb-seed.tar.gz (release.yml; the
# router itself is compiled into the app). tauri.conf.json bundles
# `resources/i2pd*`, and that glob must match at least one file or tauri-build
# fails the build. Staged files are gitignored — this one keeps the dir.
